-10T15:38:26Z"},"body":"Fixes #116281.\r\n\r\n`Node::replace_by` was removing internal nodes of the node being replaced, and was leaving them orphaned / not freed. Now internal nodes are left in place / are not removed at all.\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar sc := ScrollContainer.new()\r\n\tadd_child(sc)\r\n\tprint(get_orphan_node_ids())\r\n\r\n\tsc.replace_by(Node.new())\r\n\tprint(get_orphan_node_ids())\r\n\t\r\n\tsc.free()\r\n\tprint(get_orphan_node_ids())\r\n```\r\nExample output:\r\n- v4.6.stable.official [89cea1439]:\r\n```\r\n[]\r\n[34611398093, 34644952527, 34678506961, 34712061395, 34745615829, 34779170263]\r\n[34644952527, 34678506961, 34712061395, 34745615829, 34779170263]\r\n```\r\n- This PR:\r\n```\r\n[]\r\n[34728838609, 34762393043, 34795947477, 34829501911, 34863056345, 34896610779]\r\n[]\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116286/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url"